#ddev-generated
## Description: Run Drupal core's dr CLI
## Usage: dr [flags] [args]
## Example: "ddev dr list" or "ddev dr cache:rebuild" or "ddev dr install standard"

if ! command -v dr >/dev/null 2>&1; then
